e dans le temps pour vivre leur tout premier vol en montgolfière ! Puis, Charlie les emmenera rencontrer la célèbre aviatrice Amelia Earhart. Au fil de leur voyage, Charlie, Yanis et Sacha découvriront comment les avions ont évolué jusqu’à aujourd’hui…","maxAge":10,"minAge":5,"abridged":false,"accents":["EU French"],"authors":["Yoto"],"copyrights":["© ℗ 2026 Yoto Ltd. Produit par BLYND."],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/pSdT1ogynSsFYFIpS_W2qfwMTq_yvsQbEfxpGNGyuhw"},"languages":["fr"],"media":{"duration":2050,"fileSize":33183249,"hasStreams":false},"narrators":["Marc Wilhelm","Justine Hostekint","Benjamin Vandecasteele","Emmanuelle Lambrey"],"status":{"name":"new","updatedAt":"2025-12-29T10:35:45.121Z"}},"slug":"les-brain-bots-les-avions","title":"Les BrainBots : les avions","userId":"yoto","sortkey":"les-brain-bots-les-avions","clubAvailability":[{"store":"uk"},{"store":"us"},{"store":"ca"},{"store":"au"},{"store":"eu"}],"cardId":"3gXcF","createdAt":"2025-12-29T10:35:51.862Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-29T09:23:55.580Z"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":true,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":true,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":false}}